      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Blackfalds Visitor Information Centre, co‑located with the Historical Society and Chamber of Commerce, lets visitors learn about local history and events.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.travelalberta.com/listings/blackfalds-visitor-information-centre-9801",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2021 the AJHL’s Blackfalds Bulldogs, formerly the Calgary Mustangs, moved to Blackfalds, bringing junior hockey to town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blackfalds",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Abbey Centre offers year‑round family fun with an indoor aquatic centre, a three‑story play space, and the country’s only indoor Trans Canada Trail section.",
